# JavaScript conventions

- Keep `@nav.js` focused on hamburger / mobile nav behavior with `#hamburger` and `#navLinks`.
- Stay vanilla — no jQuery, React, or new npm packages unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve resize reset above 768px and body scroll lock while the menu is open.
- Page-specific scripts (gallery filters/lightbox, estimate form) stay in their HTML files unless extracting shared helpers is clearly beneficial.
- Do not break EmailJS field mapping in the estimate form submit handler.
